Pokemon TCG list cleaner

# Why

When people post their exports they often have different rarities of the same card which is a little hard to read and organise

# goals

[] - read different formats of lists: limitlesstcg.com/ and poke tcg app at the least
[] - convert to a common format (prefer limitlesstcg format?)
[] - output a cleaned list with only one of each card, ideally the lowest rarity, need to find an api that has "versions", or do I have to create my own database of legal cards?
[] - Create a better nav - do we want a common header nav, or do we want to use breadcrumbs?
[x] - add a colours to the comparison, red for lower than average count green for higher, no background for average
[x] - hide cards that are the same in all lists by
[x] - add toggles for table settings (colour map and hiding same cards)
[] - Should I try to cache card tooltip images or will the browser do it for us

[-] - we should keep the count of cards
[x] - unique card should be by name and set
[x] - we should be able to compare multiple lists and see what is different
[no longer needed] - maybe be able to click over a list to be the main to compare against?
[x] - I should be able to save the deck lists in local storage
